redline is a rewrite of lavish-axi (https://github.com/kunchenguid/lavish-axi)
in Go, using only the Go standard library plus modernc.org/sqlite.

Behaviour, agent-facing guidance text (design reference, playbooks, poll and
reply instructions) and parts of the browser SDK logic are adapted from
